# ===== 通用本地文件 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.log
*.tmp
*.cache
dist/
artifacts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 本仓库以 AGENTS.md + .agents/skills/ 为当前 Agent 入口；本地 Agent 状态不入库。
.codex/*
!.codex/rules/
.codex/rules/*
!.codex/rules/project.rules
.claude/
.zcode/
.local/

# ===== Web 概念预览原型 =====
# 只忽略构建与依赖产物；原型源码与概念图作为设计交付物入库。
prototypes/*/node_modules/
prototypes/*/dist/

# ===== Server =====
server/node_modules/
server/dist/
server/.env
server/.env.*
!server/.env.example
server/data/screenshots/
server/data/releases/
server/data/models/
server/data/accounts.json
server/data/accounts/

